    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d189-a2">

                <pb facs="0545" n="1175" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg1175"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure B.—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blanco to Mr. Pile</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-06-06"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 6,
                        1873</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In answer to the note of your excellency, the 4th ultimo, No. 62, I have the
                    honor to inform you that the publication in the <hi rendition="#italic">Opinion
                        Nacional</hi>, No. 1262, to which you refer, is a faithful copy of the
                    message of His Excellency the President of the republic to the Congress of the
                    nation, dated 28th of last month. I therefore return to your excellency the
                    printed slips that accompanied your note.</p>
                <p>I reiterate to your excellency the assurances of my very distinguished
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JESUS MA. BLANCO.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
